#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0013-A expect=noViolation domain=SE
#note "SE Assumptions 12/13 (SDTMIG 3.2; 10/11 in 3.3/3.4) permit adding Timing variables to SE. SESTDY and SEENDY are Timing variables that the SE list of SDTMIG 3.2/3.3 does not carry; CG0013 flagged them on the PhUSE pilot data before the SE arm moved here."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library model-column-order SE STUDYID DOMAIN USUBJID SESEQ ETCD ELEMENT SESTDTC SEENDTC TAETORD EPOCH SEUPDES
#library model-class-variables FINDINGS STUDYID:Identifier DOMAIN:Identifier USUBJID:Identifier --SEQ:Identifier --GRPID:Identifier --REFID:Identifier --SPID:Identifier --LNKID:Identifier --TESTCD:Topic VISITNUM:Timing VISIT:Timing VISITDY:Timing TAETORD:Timing EPOCH:Timing --DTC:Timing --STDTC:Timing --ENDTC:Timing --DY:Timing --STDY:Timing --ENDY:Timing --DUR:Timing --TPT:Timing --TPTNUM:Timing --ELTM:Timing --TPTREF:Timing --RFTDTC:Timing
dataset SE
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SESEQ type=Num
col ETCD type=Char
col SESTDTC type=Char
col SEENDTC type=Char
col EPOCH type=Char
col SESTDY type=Num
col SEENDY type=Num
---
S1 | SE | 001 | 1 | SCRN | 2012-07-06 | 2012-07-09 | SCREENING | -3 | 1
---
